    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e8a9af211523907dac3cb66",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心\n是从她华丽举止上难以想象的、\n极度自律的努力家。而且――\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "45c7c42cba2f2a0abfa47e3fa0fcebaf4dd737f0866bc822fcd6ad081a7796a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1d09b2d176830067be4e258",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a26c04a8af8557f331ed7076671e2fce274ed0afd52fdd6e88b73fe92f7c8e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9c144dd5ae1d8fd0c50ad40",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――这些到出道为止的训练，\n深蹲、硬举、卧推……et cetera.",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae2a149f965c829781ae5e03eb2926a53fb72e5e200d9224b4d865fc14a39181",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af28cd4628a9d5db915515f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯。你在同世代中体型稍显纤细",
      "source_fingerprint": "d603e11aab9e0064b1b8334c8faf3604dbdf729b9fa43b945c87cb9a1f1d8b44",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
