    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dc3afbcef7c3eaf11782eeb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "多是提升力量的项目呢。\n果然我的情况首先是，要从加强体能开始吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5fd0d56eaac2caf3a9568d859073c4df09344e9c3a238892b82b73df30a86d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553b87f46c40e6939354dec9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "先把基础肌力练上来",
      "source_fingerprint": "12187e1a1f6a82d978f140b77aa93589568b5d2138860fe09d7d6388a49bf3c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0498c3db6f043694e0cba66f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使锻炼了也有会出现极限的时候吧，\n但是身体的成长还在后头。\n我决定一边观察，一边努力强化体能。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "5262e8290b39a6c202c97566d86aaf6109b3561d8873c3eda495a98df4abc271",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d435705bff36a944a5e4c372",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "把最大力量提上去，和速度连接起来",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2772200901c659f85ef04ee17fab70d2e2d8886aa1819c3bc0d0ea46cba8162",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d93b923c54bfe2bcbfcd6722",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从大肌群开始锻炼，\n打好了基础再提升RFD――\n也就是爆发性发力的能力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d19a6c577cfc3155680db87f2c0863efbc3b9182ae175bc19b640ad2f87faab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f03d09e322339ebb60597e17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一边吃饭，一边翻看比赛论文。\n远离喧嚣中心，静悄悄的角落。\n――这就是自己的固定位置。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc857215da287540671d49f387fd27a9be2dc95509463f2843ad94aac833516c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86679308cc9cacf6963d0c2e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "论……论文？为什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e31a0c0ee6a982e42b790d15145c0b8ce737f23da374f60f9bd2f59ad052222f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112100.json",
