    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae67fc0bba68e2ccf8fcba98",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你要是写论文的话……\n『最大肌力与爆发性最高速度的相关性』\n……大概是这种？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a478da36b41fb3b79bd493e639b9118a72f53a32faa3a93d391c37321490a06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
